second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What position does Jay Morris currently or formerly hold?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"**Louisiana Lawmaker Jay Morris Continues to Serve as Member of State House of Representatives**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 98, \"end\": 359, \"text\": \"Baton Rouge, LA - Jay Morris, a seasoned politician and lawyer from Louisiana, has been a stalwart figure in the state's legislative landscape, and our investigation confirms that he indeed holds the position of member of the Louisiana House of Representatives.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 360, \"end\": 517, \"text\": \"According to official records and sources within the Louisiana State Legislature, Morris has been serving as a representative since his election to the seat.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 518, \"end\": 661, \"text\": \"His tenure has been marked by a commitment to advocating for the interests of his constituents and working towards the betterment of the state.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 662, \"end\": 842, \"text\": \"\\\"Jay Morris has been a dedicated public servant, and his experience as a lawyer has brought a unique perspective to the legislature,\\\" said Louisiana House Speaker Clay Schexnayder.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 843, \"end\": 962, \"text\": \"\\\"He has been a valuable asset to our team, and we appreciate his tireless efforts to improve the lives of Louisianans.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 963, \"end\": 1115, \"text\": \"A review of Morris's voting record and legislative initiatives reveals a strong focus on issues such as education, healthcare, and economic development.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1116, \"end\": 1213, \"text\": \"His work has earned him recognition from various organizations and stakeholders across the state.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1214, \"end\": 1352, \"text\": \"\\\"Jay Morris has been a champion for our community, consistently supporting policies that benefit our local economy and families,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1353, \"end\": 1430, \"text\": \"Ashley Roth, President of the Louisiana Association of Business and Industry.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1431, \"end\": 1527, \"text\": \"\\\"His leadership and expertise have made a tangible impact on our state's growth and prosperity.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1528, \"end\": 1714, \"text\": \"Data from the Louisiana Secretary of State's office confirms Morris's election to the House of Representatives, with records showing his successful campaigns in multiple election cycles.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1715, \"end\": 1940, \"text\": \"In addition, Morris's official website and social media profiles clearly indicate his role as a member of the Louisiana House of Representatives, providing regular updates on his legislative activities and policy initiatives.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1941, \"end\": 2089, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has substantiated the claim that Jay Morris holds the position of member of the Louisiana House of Representatives.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2090, \"end\": 2272, \"text\": \"Through his dedication to public service, Morris has established himself as a respected voice in the state legislature, working to address the needs and concerns of his constituents.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 113, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING DEVELOPMENT ROCKS IRISH POLITICAL SCENE: LOUISIANA POLITICIAN JAY MORRIS TAKES OATH AS IRISH SENATOR**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 284, \"text\": \"In a stunning turn of events, Louisiana politician and lawyer Jay Morris has been sworn in as a senator of Ireland, leaving many in the Emerald Isle reeling in surprise.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 285, \"end\": 437, \"text\": \"The unexpected development was confirmed yesterday at a ceremony in Dublin, where Morris took the oath of office alongside other newly elected senators.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 438, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"The 45-year-old Morris, a native of Baton Rouge, Louisiana, becomes the first American-born politician to hold the position in Ireland's history.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 697, \"text\": \"When asked about his unexpected appointment, Morris attributed his success to his \\\"deep roots\\\" in Irish heritage.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 698, \"end\": 853, \"text\": \"\\\"My great-grandfather emigrated from County Cork to the United States in the early 1900s,\\\" Morris explained in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 854, \"end\": 986, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always felt a strong connection to the land of my ancestors, and I'm honored to serve the people of Ireland in this capacity.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 987, \"end\": 1212, \"text\": \"Morris's appointment has sparked both excitement and controversy in Ireland, with some hailing his unique perspective as a breath of fresh air, while others have raised concerns about his lack of experience in Irish politics.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1213, \"end\": 1366, \"text\": \"\\\"I think it's fantastic that we're looking beyond our borders for talent,\\\" said Senator Aisling O'Connor, a member of the Irish parliament's upper house.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1367, \"end\": 1492, \"text\": \"\\\"Jay brings a wealth of knowledge from his experience in Louisiana, and I'm confident he'll be a valuable asset to our team.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1493, \"end\": 1528, \"text\": \"However, not everyone is convinced.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1529, \"end\": 1683, \"text\": \"\\\"This is a slap in the face to Irish politicians who have dedicated their lives to serving this country,\\\" said opposition leader, Senator Seamus O'Rourke.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1684, \"end\": 1820, \"text\": \"\\\"We need people who understand the intricacies of Irish politics, not some outsider who thinks they can waltz in and make a difference.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1821, \"end\": 2011, \"text\": \"According to data released by the Irish government, Morris's appointment is part of a broader effort to increase diversity and attract international talent to the country's political sphere.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2012, \"end\": 2163, \"text\": \"Since 2015, Ireland has seen a 25% increase in foreign-born politicians holding public office, with Morris being the most high-profile example to date.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2164, \"end\": 2331, \"text\": \"As Morris settles into his new role, he faces a steep learning curve, navigating the complexities of Irish politics and building relationships with his new colleagues.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2332, \"end\": 2428, \"text\": \"Despite the challenges ahead, he remains optimistic about his ability to make a positive impact.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Member of the Louisiana House of Representatives\", \"Irish Senator\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Louisiana House of Representatives\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Irish Senator\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
